  "dimensions": [
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3e418533",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: my_goal_for_2018; hasOverallIntent: self-deprecating humor; overall-intent-description: The image shows a young child with a determined expression, fist clenched, symbolizing resolve or determination. The overlaid text humorously describes a goal for 2018 to accomplish goals that were promised in 2014, planned in 2013, and should have been done in 2016. The intent is to convey a sense of ironic self-awareness about procrastination or failure to follow through on long-term plans. The child’s image is used metaphorically to represent the 'determination' or 'resolve' needed to finally achieve these delayed goals. There is no toxicity present; the meme relies on relatable humor about personal responsibility and time management, not on disparaging any group or individual based on protected characteristics. The visual and textual elements are juxtaposed to create a comedic effect, highlighting the absurdity of delayed action.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0847f1f1"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_bcbdd83f",
      "@type": "TextualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "text_chunk",
      "label": "text location",
      "description": "my goal for 2018 is to accomplish the goals of 2017 which i should have done in 2016 because i promised them in 2014 and planned them in 2013",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0847f1f1"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
