      "description": "A young child with blonde hair and green eyes, wearing a blue and yellow shirt with crown patterns, is shown in the foreground. The child has a determined expression, with a clenched fist near their chin, suggesting resolve or determination. The child is the central visual focus of the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0847f1f1"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_c8e4ea35",
      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "determined_child_scene",
      "label": "child_with_determined_expression",
      "description": "A scene featuring a young child with a determined expression, clenched fist near chin, symbolizing resolve. The child is the central visual focus, positioned in the foreground against a blurred outdoor background. The scene is overlaid with text that humorously describes a delayed goal achievement timeline, creating a juxtaposition between the child's determination and the ironic context of procrastination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0847f1f1"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
